e the finance  side of it i'm hosting a full day on  wednesday we're having great turnout  from finance ministers and financial  companies from around the world  committed to transforming our financial  system to make it  fit for the future to help with the  transition and there's great news there  if you look at london just this week the  uk has been named best place in the  world for green finance we issued our  second sovereign green bond which now  makes us the largest uh those are the  third largest issuer of sovereign green  bonds anywhere in the world and we've  only been going a month so you know  actually there's there's lots there's  lots to celebrate and actually i think  will be a big success
 

